🚀 Day 20 Of hashtag#90DaysOfDevOps

Today I worked on a log_analyzer.sh script that automates log analysis and reporting.

✅ Validates input files
✅ Counts ERROR and Failed events
✅ Detects CRITICAL incidents with line numbers
✅ Identifies the Top 5 recurring error messages
✅ Generates a detailed summary report
✅ Archives processed logs automatically

This project helped me strengthen my Bash scripting skills while working with tools like grep, sed, sort, uniq, and shell scripting concepts such as loops, conditionals, and file handling.

Small automation scripts like this can save significant time when troubleshooting server and application logs.
